# Folder synchronization, upload only (specs/003-folder-sync US4). Run after 13-sync-proposals.walk with the same server and folders: the reader's Downloads folder is the
# Outbox of a pair with the server folder Documents; its files go to the server through the queue, and the files on the reader stay where they are.
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeSync
waitfor syncPairRow
tap syncAdd
waitfor pairServerFolder
tap pairServerFolder
waitfor chooserRow
tap chooserRow 2
waitfor chooserPath Documents
tap chooserChoose
waitfor pairServerFolder Documents
tap pairReaderFolder
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerRow 0
wait 500
tap pickerChooseFolder
waitfor pairReaderFolder Downloads
tap pairDirection 1
wait 300
expect pairDirection Upload only (selected)
tap pairSave
waitfor dialogText can be sent to
tap footerButton 1
waitfor syncPairRow
shot @OUT@/119-two-pairs.png
# the second pair's menu: Sync (the first pair is row 0 of the list, this one is the next)
tap syncPairRow 1
wait 400
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor planTotals upload
shot @OUT@/120-plan-uploads.png
expect planRowCaption Upload
tap planApprove
waitfor resultCounts uploaded
shot @OUT@/121-result-uploaded.png
tap resultDone
waitfor syncPairRow
